      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The naiad water guardian's last action this turn was a successful Strike against a creature within 30 feet</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The naiad yells a command at the creature they hit The target must succeed at a DC 22 Will Saving Throw save or spend the first action on its next turn doing as commanded (or all its actions on its next turn on a critical failure) The naiad can command a creature to approach them, release what its holding, or drop Prone Regardless of the result of its save, the creature is temporarily immune for 10 minutes.</p>",
